# Sentiment Analysis Research Project

**RoBERTa • Two-Layer ("Two-State") GRU • VADER • Word2Vec • ONNX • OpenVINO (FP32/FP16) • NNCF INT8**

An end-to-end sentiment classification research pipeline comparing a transformer
model (RoBERTa), a recurrent model (Word2Vec + two-layer GRU), and a rule-based
baseline (VADER), then optimizing the trained models for edge/production inference
through ONNX export, OpenVINO conversion (FP32/FP16), and OpenVINO NNCF INT8
quantization — all benchmarked on **Accuracy, Precision, Recall, and F1-score**
across the **IMDb** and **Sentiment140** datasets.

## Project Objectives

| # | Objective | Location |
|---|-----------|----------|
| 1 | RoBERTa fine-tuning | `src/roberta_model.py` |
| 2 | Two-Layer ("Two-State") GRU | `src/gru_model.py` |
| 3 | VADER baseline | `src/vader_module.py` |
| 4 | Word2Vec embeddings | `src/word2vec_module.py` |
| 5 | ONNX export | `src/export_onnx.py` |
| 6 | OpenVINO FP32/FP16 + NNCF INT8 | `src/openvino_utils.py` |
| — | Evaluation (Accuracy/Precision/Recall/F1) | `src/metrics.py` |
| — | Orchestration | `src/pipeline.py` |
| — | Data (IMDb + Sentiment140) | `src/data_utils.py` |

## Repository Structure

```
sentiment-research-project/
├── README.md
